---
import { base } from "../lib/base";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Book Todd Kashdan to Speak" current="speaking">
  <div class="wrap page-hero" style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:.95fr 1.2fr; gap:44px; align-items:center;">
    <div>
      <p class="kicker">Keynotes &middot; workshops &middot; consulting</p>
      <h1>From opening for the Dalai Lama to the TEDx <em>stage</em>.</h1>
      <p class="lead">For over 20 years, Todd and his Well-Being Lab have researched the conditions that lead to optimal psychological functioning in life, social relationships, and the workplace. He translates that science into entertaining, accessible, actionable content that inspires and delivers the results organizations seek.</p>
      <a class="btn solid" href="mailto:todd@toddkashdan.com">Invite Todd to Speak</a>
    </div>
    <div><img src={base + "images/speaking-hero.webp"} alt="Todd Kashdan speaking on stage at Tomorrow's Procurement Leader 2025 Americas, gesturing to the audience" style="width:100%; height:auto; border-radius:12px;" /></div>
  </div>

  <div class="section logo-band wrap">
    <div class="sec-h"><h2>Organizations Todd has worked with includes</h2></div>
    <div class="logo-grid">
      <div class="logo-chip"><img src={base + "images/img_027.png"} alt="Mercedes-Benz" style="height:auto; max-height:88px;" /></div>
      <div class="logo-chip"><img src={base + "images/img_028.png"} alt="Microsoft" /></div>
      <div class="logo-chip"><img src={base + "images/img_029.png"} alt="American Express" /></div>
      <div class="logo-chip"><img src={base + "images/img_030.png"} alt="World Bank" /></div>
      <div class="logo-chip"><img src={base + "images/img_031.png"} alt="General Mills" /></div>
      <div class="logo-chip"><img src={base + "images/img_032.png"} alt="Merck" /></div>
      <div class="logo-chip"><img src={base + "images/img_033.png"} alt="Gap" /></div>
      <div class="logo-chip"><img src={base + "images/img_034.png"} alt="BBDO" /></div>
      <div class="logo-chip"><img src={base + "images/img_035.png"} alt="Prudential" /></div>
      <div class="logo-chip"><img src={base + "images/img_036.png"} alt="Gensler" /></div>
      <div class="logo-chip"><img src={base + "images/standard-chartered.png"} alt="Standard Chartered" style="height:auto; max-height:88px;" /></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section wrap">
    <div class="sec-h"><h2>What people say</h2></div>
    <div class="grid3">
      <div class="quote">
        <p>&ldquo;Todd Kashdan was perfect. What he said was inspirational, useful, and entertaining.&rdquo;</p>
        <cite>Andrew Robertson, CEO, BBDO Worldwide</cite>
      </div>
      <div class="quote">
        <p>&ldquo;Todd's talk was incredibly engaging, focused on curiosity as a skill that supports professional exploration and success. People walked away thinking about how curiosity is essential to a growth mindset.&rdquo;</p>
        <cite>Samara Caplan, Microsoft</cite>
      </div>
      <div class="quote">
        <p>&ldquo;Each year our participants walk away raving about the experience of working with Dr. Kashdan, his energy and expertise.&rdquo;</p>
        <cite>Lara Partridge, Global Head of Talent Program, Charter Bank Group</cite>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section wrap">
    <div class="sec-h"><h2>See Todd in action</h2></div>
    <div class="video-embed">
      <iframe src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/393156584" title="Todd Kashdan speaking" allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section wrap">
    <div class="sec-h"><h2>Sample topics</h2></div>
    <ul class="topic-list">
      <li>Emotional Agility</li>
      <li>Building Curious Individuals, Teams, and Organizations</li>
      <li>Principled Rebels: The Secret to Building Group Intelligence and Wisdom</li>
      <li>The Art and Science of Resilience</li>
      <li>Optimizing Social Relationships</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="section wrap">
    <div class="sec-h"><h2>Beyond the lecture</h2></div>
    <p class="lead" style="max-width:72ch;">Todd's workshops go beyond lectures, with interactive exercises that let executives and teams practice being more curious, creative, and courageous. He has worked with government intelligence and the U.S. Armed Forces to build mental and social agility, and has helped organizations of all sizes build cultures that are both resilient and adaptable.</p>
    <p class="lead" style="max-width:72ch;">Workshops run from a half-day to five days. Attendees walk away with insight into their own behavior, the behavior of others, and how to overcome personal and social barriers. Contact Todd for examples, and let him curate an event suited to what you're looking for.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section wrap">
    <div class="news">
      <div>
        <p class="news-eyebrow">Book Todd</p>
        <h2>Every group is unique. Every engagement is tailored.</h2>
        <p>Reach Todd directly, or contact his agency, The Lavin Agency, to take the next step toward hosting an event everyone will be talking about.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="news-cta">
        <a class="btn solid" href="mailto:todd@toddkashdan.com">Email Todd</a>
        <a class="btn ghost" href={base + "contact/"}>Contact page &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
